         "headline": "Poehling sustained an apparent lower-body injury in Saturday's game versus the Flames and didn't finish the contest.",
         "text": "Poehling was coming in on a shorthanded rush and buried his shot as he got clipped. As he fell, he went legs first into the goalpost. The 27-year-old had a goal and an assist in the contest, giving him his first points through five outings this season. An update on his status should be provided prior to Tuesday's rematch versus the Flames in Anaheim.",
